(
  name: "Readable Pads",
  version: "1.0",
  author: "OpenTT",
  description: "Boost and jump pads easy to read from a distance: a semi-transparent cyan arrow stands over each boost pad, pointing where it launches you; rings rising off each jump pad mark it. Cosmetic only: the pads work as before, and players without the mod can join your games.",
